These terms ask that the Warzone 2100 Project be credited, and that
modified versions of the game not be mistaken for official releases.
They are not intended to restrict any other use permitted by the
License, and they set out in detail what does not require marking, for
the avoidance of doubt.

These additional terms apply to any file whose license notice applies
version 1.0 of the Warzone 2100 additional terms to it, including a
notice that allows any later version. They are added pursuant to
Section 7 of the GNU General Public License version 3 and supplement
that License for the material in those files.

A file whose license notice names a version of these terms "or (at your
option) any later version" is governed by that version or, at your
option, by any later version published by the Warzone 2100 Project.
Otherwise, a file is governed only by the version its notice names.
Each version of these terms will remain available.

When conveying such a file, you must keep its license notice intact and
include a copy of the version of these terms that applies.

